	"FriendlyName": "SimFlow",
	"Description": "Modular, data-driven task / flow framework for VR simulations, tutorials and gameplay sequences. Node graph authoring, sequential & parallel tasks, conditions, branching, pause/resume, retry/skip/fail and save/load. Recognises objects by gameplay tag, judges what goes into a zone, validates ordered procedures, and records what the trainee got wrong.",
